module j3.proc — Run other programs: `run` starts one, feeds it stdin, collects stdout and stderr, and waits;

fn: waitAny tryReadFd run runEnv start startIn startInEnv findProgram cString envWith
enum ProcError: NotFound ExecFailed Fail
struct Output: code out err outStr() errStr()
struct Child: pid stdin stdout stderr done code write() closeStdin() read() readErr() tryRead()
    tryReadErr() tryWait() collect() wait() kill()

signatures and comments: `j3c doc j3.proc`; one name: `j3c doc j3.proc <name>`
